{"t": 5231, "msg": {"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "id": "msg_011Ch9tTX32SKZw5j2A8wbaX", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "A new setting needs three things, and it isn't done until all three exist. First, add it to the manifest under the bar widget's schema and defaults. Second, add it to the daemon's runtime defaults, plus the TOML aliases if it belongs in the fallback config. Third, add a real control for it on a page in the pages folder, written with s dot put and the key.\n\nThe check script enforces the second and third. Skipping the control gives a setting that works from the bar command but is invisible in the UI, which has happened before.\n\nEach key is changed on exactly one page, so put it on the page whose subject it is. Both the pages and ui folders need their qmldir files kept in step.\n\nIf the setting lives on a constructed model object, it also has to be reconciled in the pipeline's apply step. A constructor argument goes in the spec it compares, a plain attribute is assigned after the spec check, and anything read from a file is reconciled outside the config-changed guard."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 14444, "cache_read_input_tokens": 10733, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 14444}, "output_tokens": 1, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "7b60301f-f9ae-4ce5-b161-c83ef237a0ff", "uuid": "47d81dcd-be7f-49b0-81c7-2d1c4ef01122", "timestamp": "2026-11-18T06:03:55.807Z", "request_id": "req_011Ch9tTWrNAokuXoA8JY6TG"}}
